  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w21.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見えなくなって、最初の朝は、しんとしていた。まかないに降りると、私の席に、湯気の椀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いつも通りの、私のぶんだ。おばちゃんには、見えないのに——手が、覚えていた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、支度を続けること。裁きの日は近い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "名簿の清書、祝いの帳面、勝ちの記録の綴じ直し。手を止めたら、この静けさに負ける気がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街に出ると、賭場の板に、私の枠が残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさんの言い分、通るか通らぬか」倍率は、今日も、少しずつ動く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰が賭けているのか、みんなもう忘れたのに——名前だけが、消えていない。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "焼き餅の列で、常連さんが首をかしげていた。「なんで俺、二枚買ったんだ?」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰にあげる気だったか、思い出せない顔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……すみません。それ、たぶん私のぶんです。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "記録室の司書さんは、来た口の人だ。いつもどおりに、迎えてくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから、閲覧札の棚を指す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「外しませんよ、ミミさんの札は。決まりに、外せとは書いてないので」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の札は、今日も棚に掛かっている。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その隣に、古い札が一枚。木は飴色で、字が掠れている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「これは?」「さあ。私が来たときには、もう」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「——四百年、返しに来ない人が、いるんですよ」……どこかで、聞いた話だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、涙が出そうになって、やめた。悲しいから、ではない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "人の目は素通りするのに——席が、椀が、板の枠が、私を覚えている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、ひとりでに、ぴんと立った。この街の習慣が、私の形に、凹んでいるのだ。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜、祝いの帳面を開くと、覚えのない字が増えていた。仲間の字、ノノさんの字、大工さんの字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「舞台の寸法、決まりました」「幕の布、良いのが入ります」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見えない一週間も、祝いは、みんなの手で進んでいた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、人混みの中で、一人だけ、私を避けた。避けた、ということは——見えている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w21.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "振り向くと、街灯の下。会社の室長が、小さく会釈した。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w21.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
